{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google DeepMind推出了新一代基因組人工智能模型AlphaGenome 2，旨在更精確地預測DNA遺傳變異如何影響人體不同類型的細胞，以及細胞在不同生物學狀態下的活動。這項技術希望幫助研究人員從海量遺傳信息中識別與疾病有關的關鍵變化，進一步揭示疾病發生機制，並為未來藥物研發尋找新的靶點。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585976.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T15:40:29.465761+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:24:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:33:45.776820+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T15:33:45.776820+00:00","content_hash":"3af59c6c5eae756ed7aeffbdba6adbf668251d5ed56eb419005365f4d29dae1d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}